WASHINGTON ––   Over the weekend, U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) arrested criminal illegal aliens convicted for despicable crimes including aggravated sexual abuse of a child, rape, corporal injuries to spouse or cohabitant, and assault with a deadly weapon.

> While Americans enjoyed their weekends, the heroic men and women of ICE were removing pedophiles, rapists, violent assailants, domestic abusers, thieves, and burglars from American streets,

said Acting Assistant Secretary Lauren Bis.

> From coast to coast, ICE never stops, even on the weekends, arresting criminal illegal aliens in our country. President Trump has made it clear: criminal illegal aliens are not welcome in the United States of America.

